
        Redux Vs Context 
            Both are useful for state management but serve different purposes.



    Feature             Context API                                         Redux
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Purpose             Manage global state for small apps                  Manage complex global state for large app.
    BoilerPlate         Less                                                More
    Performance         May cause re-renders in large apps                  Optimized with selectors
    DevTools            Basic                                               Powerful Redux DevTools   
    Best for            Theme, Auth, UI preferences                         E-commerce, dashboards, complex state logic